WEBVTT

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:18.232
Up, then.

00:00:18.432 --> 00:00:22.569
The gulls fall away below us, and the air grows thin and cold.

00:00:22.769 --> 00:00:25.939
At two thousand metres, we pass through the clouds.

00:00:26.139 --> 00:00:31.974
At ten thousand, a jet crosses our path. This is as high as most people ever get.

00:00:32.174 --> 00:00:33.990
Above us, the weather ends.

00:00:34.190 --> 00:00:35.855
Two things are still higher.

